{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Infuse VR is a headset streaming, motion compensation, cockpit calibration, and hand and gaming accessories visualisation software for VR gamers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>PLEASE NOTE:</strong> This software is a server application for Infuse VR. To use the full functionality of Infuse VR, you should install the free client application from the Meta App Store.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>WiFi / USB VR streaming</strong> <i>(FREE)</i><br>Stream VR smoothly over WiFi or USB.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Hand visualisation</strong> <i>(FREE)</i><br>See your real hands in any VR game with zero setup.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Gaming accessories visualisation</strong> <i>(ONE ACCESSORY FREE)</i><br>Visualise your joystick, yoke, steering wheel, or other gaming gear in VR during the gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2705 <strong>Multiple profiles</strong> <i>(FREE)</i><br>Create and switch between setups for different games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Motion compensation</strong> <i>(PRO DLC)</i><br>Enjoy ultra-low latency, high precision motion compensation for any motion simulator.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Cockpit calibration &amp; virtual-real sync</strong> <i>(PRO DLC)</i><br>Synchronise your physical cockpit with the virtual cockpit for a seamless digital mixed reality experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udd13 <strong>Custom controller uploads</strong> <i>(PRO DLC)</i><br>Create and upload your own 3D controller models if they\u2019re not in our database.<br><br><strong><u>A 5-hour PRO trial is available!</u></strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2532240?t=1751959659","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamsta